    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Terraspace! Here you have to go on an exciting journey through the galaxy and build a spaceship that will help you move to another planet. But this is not just a construction game \u2014 it's a whole universe where you can show your skills as a strategist and engineer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/6e1800eea562f93a4d330fd5177205f4.poster.avif?t=1750187850\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/6e1800eea562f93a4d330fd5177205f4.webm?t=1750187850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/6e1800eea562f93a4d330fd5177205f4.mp4?t=1750187850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game &quot;Terraspace&quot; you will be engaged in the construction of equipment that will allow you to extract the necessary resources: food, water, electricity and other consumables. You will have to plan your actions carefully to provide your team with everything necessary for survival in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your main goal is not to destroy the astronauts and build a spaceship that can transport you to another planet. To do this, you will need to create new designs and collect resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/df340da685f6e0a456252ccf18158c7d.avif?t=1750187850\" data-has-big width=800 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features of the game &quot;Terraspace&quot;:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* A variety of technologies and designs to create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Addictive and addictive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Beautiful graphics and atmospheric soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the most exciting journey of your life? Then welcome to the game &quot;Terraspace&quot;, where every step you take will matter, and every decision will affect the outcome of the entire mission!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Terraspace! Here you have to go on an exciting journey through the galaxy and build a spaceship that will help you move to another planet. But this is not just a construction game \u2014 it's a whole universe where you can show your skills as a strategist and engineer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/6e1800eea562f93a4d330fd5177205f4.poster.avif?t=1750187850\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/6e1800eea562f93a4d330fd5177205f4.webm?t=1750187850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/6e1800eea562f93a4d330fd5177205f4.mp4?t=1750187850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game &quot;Terraspace&quot; you will be engaged in the construction of equipment that will allow you to extract the necessary resources: food, water, electricity and other consumables. You will have to plan your actions carefully to provide your team with everything necessary for survival in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your main goal is not to destroy the astronauts and build a spaceship that can transport you to another planet. To do this, you will need to create new designs and collect resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535330/extras/df340da685f6e0a456252ccf18158c7d.avif?t=1750187850\" data-has-big width=800 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features of the game &quot;Terraspace&quot;:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* A variety of technologies and designs to create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Addictive and addictive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Beautiful graphics and atmospheric soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the most exciting journey of your life? Then welcome to the game &quot;Terraspace&quot;, where every step you take will matter, and every decision will affect the outcome of the entire mission!</p>",
    "short_description": "The game &quot;Terraspace&quot; offers you a unique experience of planet settlement and terraforming \u2014 creating conditions for life on unsuitable planets. This will require you to build the necessary structures to populate the planet.",
